      "source": [
        "# Function annotation\n",
        "\n",
        "A function annotation is metadata attached to a function parameter or its return value. It is commonly used for type hints, but Python does not enforce it as a type check.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-function-annotation)"
      ]
    }
